### 1. Create Template
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CSE Semester 5 Template",
  "description": "Template for semester 5 academic schedules"
}

###

### 2. Get All My Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 3. Get Template By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 4. Update Template
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated CSE Semester 5 Template",
  "description": "Revised academic schedule template"
}

###

### 5. Delete Template
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}